{"id":"n66782-1-8","stage":4,"title":"알아채다 · 看破","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66782-1-8-1","ko":"유민이는 아기가 왜 우는지를 금방 알아채더라.","zh":"裕敏很快就察觉到宝宝为什么在哭了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민이는","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"유민이는","audio":"/audio/727cddb4c6676098ab15.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민이는","audio":"/audio/727cddb4c6676098ab15.mp3"}},{"text":"아기가","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"1","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아기가","audio":"/audio/26e60641381a50692ff7.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"우는지를","meaning":"哭，哭泣","explanation":"울다：哭，哭泣；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"울다","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69523","senseId":"1","lemma":"울다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우는지를","audio":"/audio/a1b2666d48d3cb1084fc.mp3"}},{"text":"금방","meaning":"马上，立刻，立马","explanation":"금방：马上，立刻，立马。","readings":[{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34764","senseId":"3","lemma":"금방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}},{"text":"알아채더라.","meaning":"察觉，看出","explanation":"알아채다：察觉，看出；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"알아채다","audio":"/audio/b08061b696807d574278.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66782","senseId":"1","lemma":"알아채다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알아채더라","audio":"/audio/e0480757ed0282f4a6cd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d5fa7c0faafdc9fc","term":"아기","zh":"小孩，婴儿","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3","entryId":"20235","definition":"吃着奶的非常幼小的孩子。","pronunciation":["아기"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"7136d2464083681e","term":"울다","zh":"哭，哭泣","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3","entryId":"69523","definition":"因为伤心、疼痛或太高兴而忍不住流眼泪；或指一边那样流眼泪一边发出声音。","pronunciation":["울ː다"]},{"id":"08c341712591f51e","term":"금방","zh":"马上，立刻，立马","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3","entryId":"34764","definition":"时间过去不久，很快。","pronunciation":["금방"]},{"id":"b08061b696807d57","term":"알아채다","zh":"察觉，看出","audio":"/audio/b08061b696807d574278.mp3","entryId":"66782","definition":"察觉，看出","pronunciation":["아라채다"]}],"audio":"/audio/05097502d18cc194c609.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66782-1-8-2","ko":"역시 애 엄마는 달라.","zh":"果然当妈妈的就是不一样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"역시","meaning":"果然","explanation":"역시：果然。","readings":[{"term":"역시","audio":"/audio/112d19723c425ab6813b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67372","senseId":"2","lemma":"역시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"역시","audio":"/audio/112d19723c425ab6813b.mp3"}},{"text":"애","meaning":"孩子，小孩","explanation":"애：孩子，小孩。","readings":[{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"1","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}},{"text":"엄마는","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"2","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마는","audio":"/audio/b5ba1b6e92f01ceaa826.mp3"}},{"text":"달라.","meaning":"与众不同，非同一般","explanation":"다르다：与众不同，非同一般；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"다르다","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26824","senseId":"2","lemma":"다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달라","audio":"/audio/59a33345b50233dd38db.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"112d19723c425ab6","term":"역시","zh":"果然","audio":"/audio/112d19723c425ab6813b.mp3","entryId":"67372","definition":"和所想的一样。","pronunciation":["역씨"]},{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子，小孩","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"主要加在子女名字后面，在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的女性。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"1db38b4e543bc73e","term":"다르다","zh":"与众不同，非同一般","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3","entryId":"26824","definition":"与普通的事物或人不一样，有特别的一面。","pronunciation":["다르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2028eed49e746252e961.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.136,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66782","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":122,"sequenceScore":1.9627,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["果然当妈妈的就是不一样。","今天晚上烤五花肉吃怎么样？","裕敏很快就察觉到宝宝为什么在哭了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["果然当妈妈的就是不一样。","裕敏很快就察觉到宝宝为什么在哭了。","今天晚上烤五花肉吃怎么样？"],"answer":0}]}
